open, subprocess with shell=True,\n   core.shell_execute_cmd) and into the argument lists of non-shell\n   subprocess invocations. Sources, sinks, barriers and additional taint\n   steps are rendered from the human-reviewed labels in\n   iris/labels/labels.json (run paddle-iris-phase1-step3-pass2-20261015,\n   pass 2; all entries classification `candidate` — the reviewed label\n   state for this project, hence precision `low`; every finding needs\n   human confirmation). The confirmed sanitizer set is EMPTY: no\n   allow-list, escaping or metacharacter-neutralizing check exists on any\n   reviewed command-construction path (see iris/labels/phase1_review.md\n   section 4).","id":"py/augur/Paddle/pass2-command-injection","kind":"path-problem","name":"Paddle Pass 2: Command/Argument Injection (CWE-78)","precision":"low","problem.severity":"error"}}]},"extensions":[{"name":"iris/paddle-cwe78","semanticVersion":"0.0.1","locations":[{"uri":"file:///C:/Users/lzh/Desktop/github/PyVul-main/iris_manual/Paddle/iris/","description":{"text":"The QL pack root directory."},"properties":{"tags":["CodeQL/LocalPackRoot"]}},{"uri":"file:///C:/Users/lzh/Desktop/github/PyVul-main/iris_manual/Paddle/iris/qlpack.yml","description":{"text":"The QL pack definition file."},"properties":{"tags":["CodeQL/LocalPackDefinitionFile"]}}]},{"name":"codeql/python-all","semanticVersion":"7.0.4","locations":[{"uri":"file:///E:/codeql-codeql-cli-2.25.2/python/ql/lib/","description":{"text":"The QL pack root directory."},"properties":{"tags":["CodeQL/LocalPackRoot"]}},{"uri":"file:///E:/codeql-codeql-cli-2.25.2/python/ql/lib/qlpack.yml","description":{"text":"The QL pack definition file."},"properties":{"tags":["CodeQL/LocalPackDefinitionFile"]}}]},{"name":"codeql/threat-models","semanticVersion":"1.0.47","locations":[{"uri":"file:///E:/codeql-codeql-cli-2.25.2/shared/threat-models/","description":{"text":"The QL pack root directory."},"properties":{"tags":["CodeQL/LocalPackRoot"]}},{"uri":"file:///E:/co